<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#SEL"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Selbitz.</hi></speaker> <p>Du leb&#x017F;t und &#x017F;ieg&#x017F;t! Jch hab wenig<lb/>
