<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#GOETZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Go&#x0364;tz.</hi></speaker> <p>Und am Ende werden wir &#x017F;terben, oder<lb/>
