<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Adelheid.</hi></speaker> <p>Hatten &#x017F;ie keinen Kay&#x017F;er?</p><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Weis-</fw><lb/>
