<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Adel-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="163" facs="#f0167"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Adelheid.</hi></speaker> <p>Er dauert mich, &#x2014; und wie wenig<lb/>
