<sp who="#ADE"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Adelheid.</hi></speaker> <p>Lieber Junge.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Franz.</hi></speaker> <p>Jhr &#x017F;chmeichelt mir.</p> <stage>(in Thra&#x0364;nen aus-<lb/>
