<fw type="sig" place="bottom">L 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Go&#x0364;tz.</fw><lb/>
<pb n="166" facs="#f0170"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#GOETZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Go&#x0364;tz.</hi></speaker> <p>Das war mir von jeher ein fataler Ort.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ELI"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Eli&#x017F;abeth.</hi></speaker> <stage>(ließt.)</stage> <p>&#x201E;Da waren &#x017F;elb&#x017F;t einige<lb/>
