<sp who="#GOETZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Go&#x0364;tz.</hi></speaker> <p>Wer verbrannte Miltenberg?</p><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Metz-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="183" facs="#f0187"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#MET"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Metzler.</hi></speaker> <p>Wenn ihr Um&#x017F;ta&#x0364;nde machen wollt, &#x017F;o<lb/>
