<stage><hi rendition="#b">Knab (kommt)</hi></stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KNA"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Knab.</hi></speaker> <p>Ein Ham&#x017F;ter Mutter. Da! Zwey<lb/>
