<stage><hi rendition="#b">Andre Zigeunerinn (ein Kind auf<lb/>
dem Ru&#x0364;cken.)</hi></stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ERZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Er&#x017F;te Zigeunerinn.</hi></speaker> <p>Ha&#x017F;t du brav gehei&#x017F;chen.</p><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom">Zweyte</fw><lb/>
<pb n="185" facs="#f0189"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
</fw> </sp> <sp who="#ZWEZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Zweyte Ziegeunerin.</hi></speaker> <p>Wenig genug. Das Land<lb/>
